Subject: [PATCH 7.2.y 1/2] crypto: iaa - fall back to software for multi-entry scatterlists
Date: Tue,  1 Sep 2026 12:02:39 -0400
Message-ID: <20260901160240.1284216-1-sashal@kernel.org>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.53.0
In-Reply-To: <2026083133-salvation-murky-0b4c@gregkh>
References: <2026083133-salvation-murky-0b4c@gregkh>
Precedence: bulk
X-Mailing-List: stable@vger.kernel.org
List-Id: <stable.vger.kernel.org>
List-Subscribe: <mailto:stable+subscribe@vger.kernel.org>
List-Unsubscribe: <mailto:stable+unsubscribe@vger.kernel.org>
